<title>MEXICO: Abaco says had net loss in 1996.</title>
<headline>Abaco says had net loss in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abaco Grupo Financiero said Monday it had a 1996 net loss of 544.5 million pesos but gave no comparative figures for 1995.</p>
<p>The group also said in a statement that its main unit Banca Confia had a capitalization ratio of 9.5 percent at the end of 1996.</p>
